                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 760,
                  "content": "Why two modes exist, when each is used, and the principles that keep both unmistakably executive. The experience prioritizes reading and comprehension over aesthetics — in either mode, the content is the interface, and the theme is merely how it resolves.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
