                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "text-muted raised from neutral-400 (#94A3B8, 2.56:1) to neutral-500 (#64748B, 4.76:1) so small metadata — dates, read times — meets WCAG AA on white. The light hierarchy now compresses at the low end (tertiary = muted), mirroring the same intentional convergence in Dark.",
