                      "id": "ywcuy",
                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Filled actions keep the executive blue (accent-500, #2563EB) — white labels hold 5.17:1 in both modes. Text, links and icons lighten to accent-300 (#60A5FA, 7.45:1) so accented type stays AA on deep surfaces. Hover lightens (accent-400), pressed darkens (accent-600) — depth without neon.",
