                      "name": "Body",
                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Pure black backgrounds (#000), maximum-contrast white-on-black pairs, neon or saturated glow accents, glassmorphism and heavy shadows. Elevation in Dark comes primarily from surface lightening (#0B1020 → #111827 → #172033), with deeper, softer shadow tints as support.",
